---
import PageTitle from "~/components/PageTitle.astro";
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Travels">
  <PageTitle
    title="Travels"
    crumbs={["Home:/", "Travels:/travels"]}
  />

  <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-y-4">
    <p>In my family, I'm easily the one who has traveled the most. And yet, I feel I haven't traveled enough. One day I'll add pictures to the mix, but for now I'll just list where I've been.</p>
    <ul class="tw:list-disc tw:list-inside tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-y-2">
      <li>
        <span>USA (born and raised)</span>
        <ul class="tw:list-disc tw:list-inside tw:indent-4 tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-y-2">
          <li>California (born and raised)</li>
          <li>Nevada</li>
          <li>Pennsylvania</li>
          <li>New York</li>
          <li>New Jersey</li>
          <li>Florida</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>Philippines (current location)</li>
      <li>Spain</li>
      <li>France</li>
      <li>
        <span>Indonesia</span>
        <ul class="tw:list-disc tw:list-inside tw:indent-4 tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-y-2">
          <li>Bali</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>Vietnam</li>
      <li>China (transit)</li>
      <li>Singapore (transit)</li>
      <li>Mexico</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>